| Component    | ESP32 pin |
| ------------ | --------- |
| HC-SR04 TRIG | GPIO 5    |
| HC-SR04 ECHO | GPIO 18   |
| IR sensor    | GPIO 19   |
| Buzzer       | GPIO 2    |
| LED          | GPIO 4    |
| MQ-3         | GPIO 34   |
| GPS TX       | GPIO 16   |
| GPS RX       | GPIO 17   |
| ADXL345 SDA  | GPIO 21   |
| ADXL345 SCL  | GPIO 22   |
| LCD I²C      | I²C bus   |
